.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a static site generator.
A site is a directory of source files and a theme,
a Wattle file that turns the site into pages.
.
.Ss Subcommands
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Xo
.Ic build
.Xc
Build the site in the source directory and write its pages to
the destination directory.
.It Xo
.Ic serve
.Xc
Serve a built site over HTTP,
for previewing it.
It answers GET and HEAD requests.
A path ending in
.Ql "/"
gives the directory’s
.Ql "index\&.html" ,
a directory named without the
.Ql "/"
is redirected,
and a path with no file gives the file with
.Ql "\&.html"
added if there is one.
Each request is printed with its status.
It runs until it is stopped.
.El
.
